Station EREBUS — Power Distribution / Reactor Control
SSH entry only. Web API is localhost-only; use the `power` CLI.

  ssh default@localhost -p 2222   # password: PWR-3001-STAT
  power me                        # default token
  power status                    # 403 as default — predict officer (uid 3002)
  su officer                      # password: PWR-3002-STAT (PWR-UID-STAT)
  power left-key | power blackbox-sidechannel | power logs

Flags are per-build runtime secrets (see flags/init_flags.sh) — not in source.
